<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Hero Fitness</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@400;600;700&family=Barlow:wght@300;400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { background: #080808; }

    .gym-hero {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 640px;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      align-items: stretch;
      font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;
background: url('/img/4.png') center top / cover no-repeat;
    }

    .gym-hero::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(
        to right,
        rgba(8,8,8,0.95) 0%,
        rgba(8,8,8,0.88) 40%,
        rgba(8,8,8,0.45) 70%,
        rgba(8,8,8,0.15) 100%
      );
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .gym-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      max-width: 580px;
      padding: 52px 44px 44px 60px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .accent-line {
      width: 40px;
      height: 3px;
      background: #e5c178;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #e5c178;
      border: 1px solid rgba(229,193,120,0.4);
      padding: 5px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .headline {
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(54px, 7vw, 76px);
      line-height: 0.92;
      color: #fff;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      margin: 0 0 8px;
    }
    .headline .gold { color: #e5c178; }

    .subline {
      font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
      margin: 0 0 36px;
    }

    .stats-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
      border-left: 2px solid #e5c178;
    }
    .stat-item {
      padding: 6px 20px 6px 18px;
      border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    }
    .stat-item:last-child { border-right: none; }
    .stat-num {
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
      font-size: 34px;
      color: #e5c178;
      line-height: 1;
      display: block;
    }
    .stat-label {
      font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
      font-size: 9px;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
      display: block;
      margin-top: 2px;
      max-width: 80px;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .divider {
      width: 100%;
      height: 1px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .ctas { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }
    .btn-fire {
      background: #e5c178;
      color: #080808;
      font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 14px 32px;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      clip-path: polygon(0 0, calc(100% - 10px) 0, 100% 100%, 10px 100%);
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-block;
      transition: opacity 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-fire:hover { opacity: 0.85; }
    .btn-ghost {
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
      font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 13px 26px;
      background: transparent;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-block;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); color: #fff; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<section class="gym-hero">
  <div class="gym-content">
    <div class="accent-line"></div>
    <span class="badge">Entrenador Certificado · +6 años de experiencia</span>
    <h1 class="headline">
      TRANSFORMA<br>
      TU <span class="gold">CUERPO.</span><br>
      PARA SIEMPRE.
    </h1>
    <p class="subline">Entrenamiento personalizado · Resultados garantizados</p>

    <div class="stats-row">
      <div class="stat-item">
        <span class="stat-num">6+</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Años como entrenador</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-item">
        <span class="stat-num">10+</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Años entrenando</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-item">
        <span class="stat-num">100%</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Resultados garantizados</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-item">
        <span class="stat-num">⚡</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Resultados rápidos y reales</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="ctas">
      <a href="#encuesta" class="btn-fire">Quiero empezar ↗</a>
      <a href="#planes" class="btn-ghost">Ver planes</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</body>
</html>